This folder contains the code and configuration for the RapidsSE performance
test harness.

Directory layout:
  ./configs     Contains the configuration files used to define the tests
                to be run and the environment that they are to run in.
  ./septest     The SE Performance Test (septest). Contains the main python
                script that can be run. Can be run from the current directory with:
                    pipenv run python -m septest






